## Conclusion

The claim is `refuted`. The evidence explicitly and clearly demonstrates that Hunter Biden was not chairman of the Nobel Peace Prize–winning World Food Program (the UN agency). He was chairman of World Food Program USA, a separate nonprofit organization that supports the UN agency. The claim falsely conflates these two distinct entities, and the evidence from multiple independent sources—including Hunter Biden's own legal representative—directly contradicts the assertion that he chaired the Nobel Peace Prize–winning organization.

### Verdict: REFUTED

